[{"title":"婺源琉璃万灯歌","author":"李龏","text":"婺源灯匠夺天巧，做出新灯极精好。\n细细琉璃万缕中，织得禽鱼及花草。\n锦娘眷眷绣娘羞，煌芒五色耀冰毬。\n江梅盈枝玉彯蕊，离枝满树红堆头。\n水晶不瑩珠玑冷，屏间云母空烘影。\n百尺长竿横画梁，宝盖悬空系纤绠。\n绿滟鳞鳞晃曲波，斜冈蹙蹙映平坡。\n瓶中栀子豆心绽，篮里海棠绒带拖。\n午夜高堂明似昼，璧月涵光灿星斗。\n蜡香坱霭焰春阳，锦光倒射金杯酒。\n此灯绝妙世间无，乃是婺源灯画图。\n梁园下客非夸大，从今不必说姑苏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33197,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"冰壶饮歌","author":"李龏","text":"金流石烁草欲枯，炎气熇熇嘘洪炉。\n兰台兔园避处无，高堂贮冰排玉壶。\n珊瑚水晶间犀株，扇车作风转辘轳。\n水戏蜡刻鸿鸥凫，大瓜浮绿李沉朱。\n碧筒捲香?云腴，脍盘堆雪封秋鲈。\n美人笑指袁安图，汗珠滴出红罗襦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33198,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"苦寒歌","author":"李龏","text":"冻天添云埋昼光，江河胶合蛟龙僵。\n涸阴嘘风无惨烈，枯碛莽莽沙浮霜。\n蛰春老屋如冰井，兽炭烹红烘不醒。\n南山飞瀑成玉丝，哀猿?落孤松顶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33199,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"关山月","author":"李龏","text":"玉门关外月，远接黑山明。\n晃色同沙冷，飞光掩雪清。\n宿师方偃阵，游骑复窥城。\n不信长生魄，年年照战争。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33200,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"对月","author":"李龏","text":"水上重楼闭，虚空云尽收。\n十分今夜月，一片玉晨秋。\n祇有诗能写，都无价可酬。\n寥寥飞鹊外，歌吹在青楼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33201,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"道埸山灾后叶靖逸同游","author":"李龏","text":"石烂木全焦，钟鱼变寂寥。\n老僧无法说，诸佛亦魂消。\n寺有州图载，山馀窣堵标。\n嗟嗟伏虎事，谁更问前朝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33202,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"石山僧","author":"李龏","text":"禅衣挂石棱，月涧濑流冰。\n钉画扫寒壁，覆棋然夜灯。\n别来增落叶，病起损枯藤。\n说透莲花偈，相依有越僧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33203,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"华亭延恩律师","author":"李龏","text":"花会收云席，经声散窅冥。\n无言坐岩壑，随意使精灵。\n斋钵重教漆，埋龛预作铭。\n养成松上鹤，相对两眸青。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33204,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄北山僧","author":"李龏","text":"一庵猿鸟外，琢石叠禅扃。\n行道拖寒衲，消閒补坏经。\n新泉开出远，古像咒来灵。\n常忆相寻日，中岩松桂馨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33205,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠华亭延庆坦讲主","author":"李龏","text":"身不钻权贵，诸方尽说师。\n讲多禅子听，行少俗人知。\n猿护挑经锡，龙依洗钵池。\n旧房天目下，松长几秋枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33206,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄心禅人","author":"李龏","text":"寂寂古山根，閒房竹半分。\n野禽听佛偈，香草入禅薰。\n白露滴孤壁，悲风生破坟。\n昨来经世业，应已付浮云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33207,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送超海翁游金陵","author":"李龏","text":"渺渺金陵道，江天正寂寥。\n孤鸿随去影，一锡破寒飙。\n官渡潮多涸，台城寺半凋。\n离宫见杨柳，莫折弄春条。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33208,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送僧归杼山","author":"李龏","text":"乱峰村口寺，旧有昼公房。\n鸟宿猿啼处，风吹月在傍。\n揭云松景黑，涸石藓痕黄。\n明日烟霞外，相望隔夕阳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33209,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送僧广明","author":"李龏","text":"忽辞同侣去，自喜水烟浓。\n江草有閒色，野僧无定踪。\n衣韬方眼笠，瓶系曲枝筇。\n明宿枫桥寺，先听夜半钟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33210,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题赠然镜潭","author":"李龏","text":"象圜非假铸，湛湛一泓深。\n独露古今体，静涵天地心。\n月沉声不响，云晦影无侵。\n定起何人会，鱼龙识梵音。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33211,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄辉老","author":"李龏","text":"八十空门侣，如君有几僧。\n眼明非服药，身健不扶藤。\n云缀搜吟笔，花纷说戒灯。\n小师亲得法，新度碓头能。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33212,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"与昭庆因律师","author":"李龏","text":"西湖戒坛寺，近逼九重天。\n师住无他恼，人言有宿缘。\n莲香熏梵裓，柳色护斋筵。\n四分南山律，今谁可共宣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33213,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日题吴兴岘山寺","author":"李龏","text":"花草满苕阳，东风隔短墙。\n洼樽残叶烂，坏塔老藤僵。\n鸽暝栖苔殿，僧寒闭竹房。\n荒阡人哭散，惟觉纸烟香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33214,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送客赴边任","author":"李龏","text":"山阳今近敌，君去酒当呼。\n不为留行役，闲因说道途。\n春沙邮骑老，夜雨戍楼孤。\n袖里酬君剑，须将示丈夫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33215,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"河轩初秋夜坐","author":"李龏","text":"涤热屡呼茶，河轩去郭赊。\n云红初夜月，风白久晴沙。\n树暗惟闻蚻，波明间跃蛙。\n松江鲈入思，客老愧浮家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33216,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题车盖实公庵","author":"李龏","text":"云火欲烧天，得凉过得仙。\n蛙随残雨闹，犬护一僧禅。\n竹色摇山磴，荷声拂水田。\n别期秋月夜，来借石床眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33217,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雨楼晚思","author":"李龏","text":"红叶入溪树，悽悽吟思微。\n雨连秋市暗，钟绕暮天飞。\n浅井阴萤出，高城宿鸟归。\n谁知凭栏处，愁响隔林机。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33218,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游空相寺追忆辉老兼怀伯弜诗","author":"李龏","text":"山门掩夕曛，芳草绿纷纷。\n蛛殿县阴火，鸦城聚冷云。\n探吟僧灭度，寄静客离群。\n何处增惆怅，秋房驳藓文。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33219,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题友人郊居","author":"李龏","text":"鸥鹭群栖地，幽人长闭关。\n孤村皆是水，叠石自为山。\n春雨车溪外，秋风笠泽间。\n短篱忘世味，惟看钓舟还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33220,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"乌程赵尉厅冬夜诗宴","author":"李龏","text":"论诗仙吏宅，酒罢夜寒增。\n雪映高城月，风吹古岸冰。\n入桥闻短棹，隔坞见微灯。\n重愧羁吟客，青云去未能。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33221,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送溧阳友人依茅山玉宸观主","author":"李龏","text":"抱琴游帝里，一帽两靴尘。\n忽忆归金濑，还谋老玉宸。\n鱼分仙涧月，虎让古山春。\n伏事陶弘景，终非是俗人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33222,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"樗翁朱安叔下省","author":"李龏","text":"真儒方进用，春榜又遗贤。\n时屈道终在，才高人共怜。\n休疑考官眼，且结作诗缘。\n桃李东风外，身闲却是仙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33223,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"凭栏呈刘季良","author":"李龏","text":"傲贫成白首，万事不相关。\n有病身元懒，无官心更閒。\n红尘抛永日，黄叶换秋山。\n欲识冥冥意，孤鸿夕照间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33224,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"道院春日","author":"李龏","text":"褰帘捲竹房，僧去罢焚香。\n湿树流残雪，疏篱挂夕阳。\n花迟春意静，苔密冻痕光。\n野水盈愁望，寻巢燕已忙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33225,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"刈田","author":"李龏","text":"刈田秋雨外，孤屿集罛师。\n红树笼斜照，青篙网细丝。\n钟殷山麓寺，灯淡野塘祠。\n一片凫鹥水，羞来鉴白髭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33226,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送赵子真尉进贤","author":"李龏","text":"王孙为一尉，古邑近西山。\n梅福仙名在，此官非等閒。\n水程蟂孽后，野店鼠逃间。\n未必须三考，应持鹗表还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33227,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送赵子真赴信州司户","author":"李龏","text":"鸣铎临征路，信州非路程。\n官曹有名胜，版赋足修明。\n地富饶银母，山清韫水精。\n贫交以贫累，不得伴君行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33228,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贻赵司户","author":"李龏","text":"同往争名地，回头二十年。\n君今官幕府，我费客游钱。\n夜雨梨花店，春风柳絮船。\n浇情一尊酒，逢在冶亭边。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33229,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九衢 其一","author":"李龏","text":"九衢名利路，日有是非尘。\n所以隐沦客，栖于寂寞滨。\n秋声飞野柳，凉色弄溪蘋。\n赢得身心净，人间不愧人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33230,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九衢 其二","author":"李龏","text":"小窗临竹地，借住半年过。\n枕上感秋事，月中闻棹歌。\n青山无力买，白发有痕多。\n那得成渔计，江村自养和。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33231,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"张约啸岩书院","author":"李龏","text":"雅调背时流，月分吟外秋。\n墨研青嶂石，茶泛碧霞瓯。\n果熟猿难唤，松寒鹿自游。\n风前横一笛，不必更登楼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33232,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"看桃偶集僧舍","author":"李龏","text":"看桃临水寺，幽会得文襟。\n移石分花坐，含毫对酒吟。\n日斜幡影倒，风断磬声沉。\n人散清溪暮，莺啼出柳林。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33233,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"与箬溪焕上人夜坐","author":"李龏","text":"一庵秋色里，共坐佛灯前。\n风引上香磬，月浮煎茗泉。\n袖寒沙气逼，窗迥树声悬。\n语罢鸦栖定，山僧入夜禅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33234,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送张将领","author":"李龏","text":"平生凭一箭，此去必成名。\n晚月催行色，秋风入别情。\n潮分江口镇，山拥石头城。\n匹马烟尘外，当开骠骑营。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33235,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶饮溪寺","author":"李龏","text":"疏雨过长林，溪头日半沉。\n开尊成草酌，得句嚼花吟。\n蜗砌苔堆湿，蛛帘柳映深。\n倚栏秋欲暮，醉耳怯寒砧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33236,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云间赠别薛沂叔","author":"李龏","text":"水竹居成久，何因又出山。\n有诗悬肘后，无事在人间。\n短剑丹霞锓，扁舟白石间。\n野情元不定，遥载鹤雏还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33237,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅","author":"李龏","text":"草木尽凋残，孤标独耐寒。\n瘦成唐杜甫，高抵汉袁安。\n雪里开春国，花中立将坛。\n年年笑红紫，翻作背时看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33238,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"癸卯元日","author":"李龏","text":"一檐朝雨若轻尘，新历虽开未是春。\n著出隐衣朝太帝，送来名纸谢同人。\n故园有弟音书绝，要路无亲旅食贫。\n五十平头今日到，不堪卧病似漳滨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33239,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送僧过建康","author":"李龏","text":"一酌离亭桑落酒，毵毵短发长愁苗。\n秋房已弃星居屋，晚寺应投旦过寮。\n歌哭尽从流水去，荣枯半逐暗尘消。\n江船载月敲铜斗，莫向台城问六朝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33240,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吴下春阴","author":"李龏","text":"云揭繁阴雨乍收，吴王故国悄如秋。\n春光物态千年在，草色人心一样愁。\n香径有时迷野蝶，帆泾无处觅沙鸥。\n桃花欲谢清明近，两鬓霜丝感昔游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33241,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋日山家","author":"李龏","text":"露华渗冷入綀袍，独坐云亭日易高。\n林茂不知山色减，石枯因见水痕牢。\n避人黑鼠窥茅栗，引子黄猿拾楮桃。\n野老欲论城市事，远教童稚觅香醪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33242,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水轩遣怀","author":"李龏","text":"漠漠风烟滃绿阴，小轩多是暗愁侵。\n逗明月落杜鹃叫，向晚雨寒蚯蚓吟。\n一镜自知添鹤发，五湖谁解食鱼心。\n带春应有馀花在，吴苑荒残不可寻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33243,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古项王祠","author":"李龏","text":"册帝追王事总非，残碑犹自对斜晖。\n庙无人到苔痕古，地有蛇盘树色肥。\n月暗野风吹鬼火，尘昏沙雨驳神衣。\n乌江渡口停骓处，今日谁知作钓矶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33244,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"退将","author":"李龏","text":"自惭战阵未曾亲，便待归田养幸身。\n随仗马闲秋骨瘦，打毬单散晓眉嚬。\n游边尚忆擒虓将，画阁何堪作老臣。\n昨日望春门外过，铁鞭惆怅暗生尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33245,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶憩破寺","author":"李龏","text":"当轩水渍一池苔，竟日无人见客来。\n飞鸟忽从花下出，游僧恰自雨中回。\n半边枯树雷烧破，几段残碑雪冻开。\n檀施只今何处在，金容冷对石炉灰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33246,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋初漫吟","author":"李龏","text":"吟肠悽断月苍苍，促织声中露未凉。\n高挂酒经缘抱病，閒看药录为参方。\n久要兄弟书皆绝，旋雇奴童住不常。\n拟续逐贫扬子赋，笔黏尘网砚池荒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33247,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吊松山曹可择","author":"李龏","text":"供奉芸签内殿间，身清不愧是卑官。\n带残敕号绦应断，吟出新诗板未刊。\n妾引哀歌秋烛暝，客收闲迹晓松寒。\n端平才子如君者，免死江湖把钓竿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33248,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"喜宥寺梅屋","author":"李龏","text":"幽幽一屋巧藏春，花匠何曾动斧斤。\n逐朵似裁霜汉月，满椽如架石桥云。\n繁花绰有苔钱赁，清梦那无蝶羽分。\n欠得玉人相共住，金樽檀板送斜曛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33249,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋晓闻鹤唳","author":"李龏","text":"角断钟残月尚明，谁家霜鹤唳蘋汀。\n空檐竹上滴寒露，野水城边沉晓星。\n清带离情穿碧户，远将秋思入苍冥。\n往年礼谒茅司命，曾记升元顶上听。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33250,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜归","author":"李龏","text":"风急漏声断，月斜人影长。\n残灯收短市，鸳瓦已凝霜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33251,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏老桐","author":"李龏","text":"枯心不作花，仪凤那采取。\n何当被朱弦，赍身大晟府。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33252,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠舟上人","author":"李龏","text":"放浪诗骚外，尘心鍊到空。\n白云开夜观，海月冷松风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33253,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"倚楼","author":"李龏","text":"客意入灯篝，无诗过一秋。\n角声吹雨断，人在截云楼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33254,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"留别范可叔","author":"李龏","text":"吴皋一水几番行，鸥鹭相逢眼亦青。\n一别隔年头白尽，离歌今日不须听。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33255,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渔父引","author":"李龏","text":"渔伴归来语笑喧，尽携筒罩醉云根。\n自从城里鱼增税，船在江村不入门。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33256,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"代赠牧马将","author":"李龏","text":"草枯水冷马添臕，箭放鸣髇不射雕。\n塞北又传烽火动，冠军人望霍票姚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33257,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寒食日","author":"李龏","text":"读尽唐人寒食诗，人于此日重伤悲。\n如今裹饭吴中俗，可是相沿为子推。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33258,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"楚宫秋怨","author":"李龏","text":"水殿芙蓉拆锦苞，暮檐小网集蟏蛸。\n射麋人醉秋江畔，风罥尘丝落燕巢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33259,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"张氏池亭饮归","author":"李龏","text":"金荷杯冷酒醺醺，重费残花一夜春。\n横玉声乾桃叶渡，断云空惹舞靴尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33260,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"淳祐辛丑元日","author":"李龏","text":"滴酒焚香把笔熏，未书名纸谒朱门。\n对天大写宜春字，先与孤寒忏宿根。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33261,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杜鹃","author":"李龏","text":"心声叫出思归苦，叫得春风破胆愁。\n江北江南皆蜀客，年来添白几人头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33262,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"一片","author":"李龏","text":"一片青萝络纬啼，星稀月没未闻鸡。\n数声柔橹斜窗外，彷佛风光罨画溪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33263,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"僧去","author":"李龏","text":"僧去焚香白昼空，客窗斜掩楝花风。\n黄鹂舌结春归尽，烟雨满林闻郭公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33264,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闲倚","author":"李龏","text":"春风楼外白云堆，壁上尘昏雨后苔。\n倚尽夕阳窗欲掩，小风犹抱落花来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33265,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送高可久游越","author":"李龏","text":"东风大扇九区春，吴下吟人发广津。\n欲上会稽探禹穴，桃花和雨扑离巾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33266,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赋元秀坐主孤峰","author":"李龏","text":"一峰峭立俯群山，下有僧居一体閒。\n收拾春烟与秋雨，年年曾在碧苔间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":33267,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}}]